# pylon - barrier pylon (ground prop; the developer draws the energy wall sideways from the emitters).
# 16x16, 2 frames, straight top-down. light: top-left. K exterior outline, seams at the struts.
# Layout: olive pillar (cols 5-10) with a 2x2 violet core; steel struts (rows 7-8) to two violet
# emitter heads (cols 0-3, 12-15) whose outer column faces the wall direction.
# Wall emission points: x=0 and x=15, rows 4-11 (emitter column), i.e. centre y=8 (edge coords).
# Palette: olive b c d e, steel 2 3, violet u v V i I, K. Frames: 0 idle, 1 pulse (heads + core brighten). 200 ms each.
palette
. transparent
